00:00:38.806 --> 00:00:41.775 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JONATAN JULIEN, ministre,

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.776 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Énergie et Ressources naturelles

00:00:40.841 --> 00:00:43.811 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il y a des assurances

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:45.012 size:53% position:73% line:53%
individur r r r r rapport

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:46.246 size:53% position:73% line:53%
