00:00:50.017 --> 00:00:53.554 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je pense que je suis bien

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:54.788 size:53% position:73% line:53%
assuré. Mais j'espère que les

00:00:52.453 --> 00:00:55.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
